    <string name="t2r_explained"><b>This feature is experimental.</b> Track should be sensible. It means that it
	should describe traveling from point A to point B but not searching one point all around. Try both algorithms
	and see what suits you better. `Cruise´ algorithm is linear and route generation time is predictable while
	`Flounce´ algorithm is totally unpredictable. Coarse sensitivity can result in missing some turns while fine
	sensitivity can add unnecessary waypoints.</string>
